      "writtenOn": "2022-03-09T00:25:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe rename this to \"is_strict_es2_mode\" or its negative? I\u0027m suggesting this because it\u0027s easy (at least for me) to confuse this with \"run only on an OpenGL ES 3 context\". I like the explicitness of using \"strict ES2 mode\" in these names since that matches the naming in `settings.fEnforceES2Restrictions` and leaves less room for confusion.",
